<title>GERMANY: BMW says Q1 97 group sales climb 22 pct.</title>
<headline>BMW says Q1 97 group sales climb 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated.)</p>
<p>    Group production (units)	     319,100 vs up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales (units)		    285,000 vs up 8 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				 14,000 vs up 22 pct</p>
<p>--of which BMW only</p>
<p>    Production				 176,000 vs up 16 pct</p>
<p>    Sales					 10,400 vs up 22 pct</p>
<p>--of which Rover Group only</p>
<p>    Production				 143,000 vs up 9 pct</p>
<p>    Sales					  3,600 vs up 21 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Bayerische Motoren Werke AG.</p>
<p>--Scott Miller, Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
